<title>UK: Ford Brazil prices $200 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Brazil prices $200 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>priced, joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Deutsche</p>
<p>Morgan Grenfell said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     9.25	MATURITY    22.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.812    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.812    SPREAD	+285 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.375</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AND PUT AT YEAR SIX AND EIGHT.</p>
<p>		SUPPORT AGREEMENT FROM FORD MOTOR CO.</p>
<p>	     ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
